section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icJYcMv2h7Ka169eFX9n14mhykGIicnZdUVVS5k9Eib0YejFNlJ5z8Wh7FyV4ksbiadYLAXwk0wiaD62KwP9m1SNNrw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icJYcMv2h7Ka169eFX9n14mhykGIicnZdUsVz5enlSCmHaLOcFzd29dabrUMy0NyJmaSRKjGmicQNToDSMCiccdA1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icJYcMv2h7Ka169eFX9n14mhykGIicnZdUuBK9fOwyyjZzh6A5qnougiclUgl609ianpkPhYbmjPFcNlWEaNXWH7hg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营火热招募中！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>为进一步促进全国优秀本科生在运动健康领域的学术交流，搭建青年学子之间深度互动与思想碰撞的平台，激发大家对该领域的探索热情与创新思维，同时深入了解学院学科建设特色、培养优势与学术氛围，上海体育大学运动健康学院拟于2026年7月举办“</span><strong><span>2026年优秀本科生暑期夏令营</span></strong><span>”。现面向相关本科培养单位公开招募学员，欢迎有志于在运动健康领域深造的优秀青年学子踊跃报名。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>part 1</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国普通高等院校2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2.达到或接近所在高校推荐2026年硕士研究生免试要求；</span></p><p><span>3.具有</span><strong><span>体育学</span></strong><span>（含运动人体科学、运动康复学等）、</span><strong><span>医学</span></strong><span>（含基础医学、医学检验、医学影像学等）、</span><strong><span>生物学</span></strong><span>（含生命科学）、</span><strong><span>医学技术</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>公共卫生与预防医学</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>营养学</span></strong><span>等相关学科背景，热爱运动，具有一定体育技能、较强的科研潜力和创新意识。</span></p><p><span>4.英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>5.遵守学术道德规范；</span></p><p><span>6.招生人数根据报名情况择优录取。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>part 2</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间及形式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年7月3日—2026年7月6日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动地点</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>上海市杨浦区恒仁路200号</span></p><p><span>上海体育大学校区内</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动费用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>交通费自理，活动期间学员的食宿由学院统一安排，原则上不安排上海高校学生住宿。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>part 3</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名填写及注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人须保证所提交信息和材料的真实、准确、完整，任何弄虚作假行为，一经查实，取消相关资格，并视情节追究相应法律责任。</span></p><p><span>2.申请截止时间：</span><strong><span>2026年6月23日17:00</span></strong><span>（以问卷星收到的报名材料为准）</span></p><p><span>3.申请提交材料（《申请表》及以下证明材料扫描件按下列清单顺序整合在一个PDF文件中并做好目录）</span></p><p><span>4.如遇上级政策调整，学院将对夏令营相关安排作适应性调整，具体以最新通知为准。</span></p><p><span>5.申请者必须填写该问卷</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xBFoQxGeqUebAHLMZZYiaiaWKRJMeUkjkf6ILlaAnqemjsKibOfv0ic9eobCSiceITJSgdiaBsbic94ZClM7jsNdQuqpOqzgNyKibMp5OvkHqOJHAIg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14\"/></section></section><section><p><span>6.联系人及联系方式：</span></p><p><span>茹老师：021-65507509</span></p><p><span>王老师：021-65507356</span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><em><span>材料清单如下：</span></em></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span>（1）《2026年上海体育大学运动健康学院优秀本科生暑期夏令营申请表》（申请表需打印出来并加盖二级学院公章，以扫描件的形式添加在Pdf中）；</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"Image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/xBFoQxGeqUfWiaHwuBAtibqN1RLT99b2KOHDQbPM6ARTEVP4B9EWTO7ic67OSMOVtACUGbH0rPT5nDS0Oib0XfGn44yGykVBsQnNOcIVrSGicOHs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=15\"/></section></section><section><p><span>（2）本科期间成绩单（由学校教务处盖章）与总评成绩排名证明；</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明（如：英语四、六级考试成绩，托福成绩或GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>（4）其他材料（如：运动等级证书、发表论文、专利，获奖或资格证书等）</span></p><p><strong><span>（备注：以上材料在暑期夏令营报到当日需要提交纸质版复印件，同时携带原件备查）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>part 4</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>材料审核</span></b><b><span>及学员录取</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>运动健康学院将根据申请人的递交材料进行审核与筛选，最终入选夏令营学员名单将于6月25日前在“</span><strong><span>上体运康</span></strong><span>”、“</span><strong><span>上体运康研</span></strong><span>”微信公众号和“</span><strong><span>上海体育大学运动健康学院官网</span></strong><span>（https://yk.sus.edu.cn）”公布，并会通过电子邮件或短信直接通知本人，录取学员需在收到通知后1天内确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>上海体育大学运动健康学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月16日</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><hr/><p><span><span>转载自上体运康研</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5WJlxFh3zrbDMeg1UrhkvTNImFiaJ4cFkI58giaC02Lib0yCTvibwwqkROqfX5jZ1Pq2mI6rJJ3tXhExTuIicAJr8aw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"93784eafb61bfdb3801387296068bdd9231b9d7086777c8d9c6cdb8a101f953a","textLength":1186,"sourceSha256":"39bbb9be426d3fc0425c1d60abd3e3cfb2a06bca78276bb6c7f9c974e5c08a17","selector":"#js_content","attachment